      <div class="pfw" id="powerflush-widget">

        <div class="pfw-header">
          <h2>Do You Actually Need a Power Flush?</h2>
          <p>4 quick questions. We will tell you straight whether you need one, a cheaper alternative, or nothing yet.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pfw-progress">
          <span class="pfw-dot active" data-step="1"></span>
          <span class="pfw-dot" data-step="2"></span>
          <span class="pfw-dot" data-step="3"></span>
          <span class="pfw-dot" data-step="4"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="pfw-body">

          <div class="pfw-step active" data-step="1">
            <div class="pfw-step-label">Step 1 of 4</div>
            <h3 class="pfw-step-question">Which of these are you noticing?</h3>
            <p class="pfw-step-help">Tick everything that applies. Even just one symptom is worth checking.</p>
            <div class="pfw-multi">
              <label class="pfw-checkbox" data-symptom="cold-bottoms">
                <span class="pfw-checkbox-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6.5L4.5 9L10 3" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                <span class="pfw-checkbox-text">Radiators cold at the bottom (top heats up but bottom stays cool)</span>
